WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.680
For this challenge, we are going to need some matresses

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.940
This is the right spot for a soft landing

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.740
No, that's not soft

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.660
Now we have a soft landing

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:24.680
Around the net header

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.380
Super head shot

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.260
Give me a test one

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.600
I'll do one without the dive

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.700
Practice one

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.740
The Superman shot!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.200
The next challenge is to poke 50 holes into a table tennis ball

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.880
And see if we can still play with it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.460
I think this will actually fly quite wierdly in the air

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:00.700
Okay this is well over 50 holes but I think it needs a bit more

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:02.180
Just normal?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.000
Yeah

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.180
Okay...

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.460
No it's...

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.580
It's really normal actually

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:14.800
It's just a bit slower

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.140
The sound is a bit wierd

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.540
I got a wierd bounce there

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:27.260
Have to be careful not to be the ball breaker on this one...

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.300
Don't break it!

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.900
Okay so that didn't bounce wierd enough so we are making more holes

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:38.420
And once again

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.160
We are doing this so that you don't have to break your brand-new Pongfinity balls

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.260
When you get them from our store

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:44.800
Before and after!

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.120
Let's try it!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:52.800
It's...

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.300
I don't know what's wrong with it

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.300
Okay this is well over 50 holes

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.460
It's like there's something wierd about it

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:01.220
It doesn't grip

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.020
Like it... drops down

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.880
The sound is so wierd

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:08.820
Can you hear the sound?

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:20.840
Less spin, less speed and a wierd sound

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:22.420
That was good

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.140
Thanks!

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.140
To the next challenge!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:27.460
Okay next let's try to do some net serves

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.160
One

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:33.700
Two

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:35.340
Three

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:38.500
Four

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.080
Five

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:41.560
Six

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.280
Seven

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:46.960
Eight

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:48.540
Nine

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:52.860
Nice!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.840
The one who drops out last wins!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.080
Ready, set, go!

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.280
Nice rhytm

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.420
This is intense

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.200
Ok so the idea is to get one bounce

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.300
Pass it over

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.120
Two bounces

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.120
Pass it over

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:25.900
Until you miss!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.600
Ooh, it's still in!

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.960
But that was four, no!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.220
I miscounted!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:53.960
Nice!

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.180
Yes!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.840
No!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.980
This is really fun to play actually!

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.100
This is so addicting!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.740
We just wanna beat the record!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.080
Good save!

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.960
Okay Emil, five!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.620
Oh sorry!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.740
That was a really good save to get the fifth

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.580
On table still

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.060
Definitely not an easy challenge!

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.240
You have to try this out!

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.360
See how many you can get

